What:		/sys/devices/.../fnmode
Date:		2026-05-23
KernelVersion:	TBD
Contact:	linux-input@vger.kernel.org
Description:
	Control the touch bar function/special key mode.
	Accepted values:
	  0: function keys only
	  1: default special keys, hold Fn for function keys
	  2: inverse of mode 1
	  3: special keys only
	  4: escape key only
	Reads back the current mode as an integer and newline.

What:		/sys/devices/.../dim_timeout
Date:		2026-05-23
KernelVersion:	TBD
Contact:	linux-input@vger.kernel.org
Description:
	Control the dim timeout in seconds.
	Accepted values:
	  >0: dim after timeout when there is no keyboard, touchpad or touch bar input
	   0: keep display dimmed
	  -1: disable dim timeout (never dim)
	  -2: auto-calculate based on idle_timeout
	Reads back the configured timeout, with -2 indicating auto mode.

What:		/sys/devices/.../idle_timeout
Date:		2026-05-23
KernelVersion:	TBD
Contact:	linux-input@vger.kernel.org
Description:
	Control display off behavior in seconds.
	Accepted values:
	  >0: switch display off after timeout when there is no keyboard,
	      touchpad or touch bar input
	   0: display off (input does not turn it back on)
	  -1: display always on (no automatic off)
	  -2: disable touch bar completely (mode off + display off)
	Reads back the current value as an integer and newline.

Users:
	Desktop environments and local system policy services that tune touch bar
	power/visibility behavior.
